ser":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4855-eggs-maledict","name":"Eggs Maledict","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T17:11:55-07:00","id":898410,"title":"","content":"If Perfect Face happens to be Sanctified, you basically have a bloodsucking messiah roaming the streets of your city, preaching unholy doctrines and openly devouring the sinful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-25T13:03:17-07:00","id":899303,"title":"","content":"&quot;In the blood&quot; i actually pretty close to what one of my NPCs did in my first Requiem campaign. Basically, he was a malkavian ventrue and the city's only Ordo Dracul member, save for one of the PCs it had lured into becoming his apprentice. He dressed relatively modern and didn't appear to be particularly old (and was maybe 150 years old at most in my mind).<br /> <br /> Long story short, the city was theatened by the true Fae Bloody Mary (Children of the thorns, vampires abducted by the true Fae Bloody Mary, from the &quot;The Danse Macabre&quot; supplement). One of &quot;her&quot; servants had led a bunch of her followers to seize power in the city. The Ventrue thought that fae was pretty rad and wanted to study it so he gave her apprentice the malkavia and sent her to the fae's dimension (some dark cemetery in arcadia with a crypt in the middle. When a vampire ends up there, they're sent to the crypt where the fae resides, it does something to them and after that, they're symathicaly connected to other vampires who went there and inclined to cooperate with them). The PC was a trojan, though and the ventrue wanted to see if the fae would get infected with Malkavia to see how much like vampires it really made itself. Turned out it worked and the malkavia spread to all the children of the thorns, disorganizing them enough that a counterattack became viable. Then, the ventrue figured since the experiment succeeded, the next thing to do would be to try and diablerize Bloody Mary and see what happens. He did and physically disappeared, leaving his apprentice in charge of the local Ordo Dracul. He can now appear to any former child of the thorns and all vampires infected by their variation of the Malkavia and talk with them or leave them messages. He's basically a sort of malkavian network and his original body may or may not lie in that crypt in Arcadia, he might not be sure himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7104-s-brechen","name":"S. Brechen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T09:17:09-07:00","id":901060,"title":"","content":"Out of curiosity, about how old do you reckon a vampire be before such things began manifesting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2203-corrigan","name":"Corrigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","va